WEBVTT

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:03.760
Chirp, chirp, chirp...

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.240
So hot...

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:09.530
He's here, chirp.

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:10.550
He's here, chirp!

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.030
The landlord's here, chirp!

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.560
I see...

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.480
He's here to get the rent.

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:21.260
I told you,

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:24.920
I just came back from my trip and 
don't have the money right now.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.880
Me, too.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.370
Please wait until next week.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:33.090
Grown-ups refusing to pay 25,000 yen...

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:43.660
<i>But if I pay today, I'll have 
to withdraw more tomorrow.</i>

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:48.610
<i>It's Sunday, and I'd have 
to pay the ATM fee.</i>

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:56.320
I feel sorry for the landlord,
but I'll have to have him come back.

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:10.000
Is he gone?

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:12.870
Whew.

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:14.870
Sorry, landlord.

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:18.340
"Muni"?

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:20.580
Huh?

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:25.190
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:26.930
I'll pay!

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:31.480
<b>Book of Blessings</b>

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.740
<i>He lectured me.</i>

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:06.700
<b>Fourteenth Haunting
 Late Night at the Yokai Apartments</b>

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.130
Hey, Hase, you're back?

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.330
Hey! It's been a while.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:19.560
How was your trip to Australia?

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:22.450
Looks like you had fun.

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:26.250
Nah, it was tough.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:33.700
Inaba, you look a lot thinner.

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:37.200
My new training's really hard.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:39.480
But I'm okay now.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:40.890
I see.

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:43.650
You're really changing.

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:44.530
Yeah.

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:47.780
But nothing changes.

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:49.280
Kuri!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.900
Have you been a good boy?

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.670
I brought lots of presents.

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:01.120
<i>You've changed, too, you know.</i>

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.030
Another big haul, huh?

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:10.270
Mille Valton VSOP!

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:13.980
And kiwi sherbet!

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:17.890
It must've been hard just to 
bring this stuff here, right?

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:22.620
Well, we had to get first class tickets.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:20.610
<b>Older Sister Ena-san</b>

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:22.000
Business class? No way!

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:25.030
We need to stay in a chateau-style cottage!

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:25.740
And a chateau-style cottage.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:27.610
We're going skiing again.

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:27.610
And ski tickets.

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:30.100
And go shopping.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:32.140
Send this to Japan, too.

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:33.200
It's so cold!

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:35.670
And go to a night cruise party.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.750
<b>It's Winter in Australia</b>

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.220
Just that.

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:39.620
It wasn't that bad.

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:43.330
Hase, your soul's trying to leave your body!

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:48.870
It's hard being in a family 
with a lot of girls.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:50.920
I think he might be special.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.550
Hase!

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:56.450
Oh, right.

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:58.200
I have this for Akine-san.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.410
What is it?

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.050
Opal earrings.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:06.250
I don't know if they're your thing, but...

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.670
Can I really have them?

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:11.220
Of course.

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:13.040
I hate to say it,

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.550
but they weren't that pricey,

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:16.580
so go ahead.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.030
I'm so happy!

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:20.540
Thank you, Hase-kun!

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:24.000
Ruriko-san!

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.620
Good timing, Ruriko-san.

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:27.680
Give me your hand.

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:33.080
It's a black opal ring.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.340
I'm sure you'll take it off when cooking.

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:38.810
But perhaps you can enjoy being 
fashionable the rest of the time.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.980
You never miss a beat, huh?

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:44.750
Why did you know the size of her finger?

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.960
I can tell by looking at her fingers.

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:49.420
<i>It's okay.</i>

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:51.260
<i>It's just Hase being Hase.</i>

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:54.620
And... Kuri!

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:59.040
I have a stuffed kangaroo for you!

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:02.130
And a crocodile!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.120
And a koala!

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:06.910
And this bird is called an emu!

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.740
He's such a dad!

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:10.560
<i>How did this happen?</i>

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:14.220
Hase-kun, how long are 
you staying this time?

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.810
Stay till school starts!

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.660
Of course, that's the plan!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.120
Wait!

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.930
You're going to be freeloading here again?

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:26.960
I won't be here tomorrow, I've got work.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.440
Oh, I see.

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:31.160
Go have fun.

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:37.750
I'm going to have lots of fun here!

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:42.370
I'm going to relax and 
recover from my exhaustion!

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.170
Wha...

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:46.150
Kuri won't be lonely then.

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:48.430
Okay, Ruriko-san.

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:50.040
I'll help with the cooking.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:51.950
Oh, I forgot.

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:52.720
Inaba.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:55.300
Here's your present.

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:58.060
An aboriginal art present.

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:00.820
I refuse to accept this!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.520
Let's eat!

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.270
This fried eggplant with Japanese peppers!

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:12.310
It's perfect with white rice!

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:14.870
It's almost too good!

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:19.230
Let's drink this down 
before Fukase gets back!

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.590
Please! Ruriko-san!

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:24.750
Give me a whole pot of rice!

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:27.160
Akine-chan could eat it!

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:30.570
It's really good.

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:34.500
When I come here, I can really 
feel how good rice is!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:40.380
Ruriruri's food is good home cooking!

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:42.730
And it's elegant and delicate!

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:47.570
And rice dishes are the 
basis of Japanese cooking!

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.530
Summer is the time for rice!

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:53.220
Eat good food, and you won't get heatstroke!

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:54.750
Yup!

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:56.740
Oh, my.

00:07:57.260 --> 00:08:00.120
It's a very lively night again, I see.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:01.880
Antiquary!

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.030
It's been a while!

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:07.670
Look at all these familiar faces!

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.600
So you did come back, Yushi-kun.

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:11.730
Yup.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:17.430
But I won't give Ryu-san's pendant back.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.220
You've learned to talk back!

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:23.510
And is this another newcomer?

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.710
This is my friend!

00:08:25.710 --> 00:08:26.990
Mizuki Hase!

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:29.850
He loves this apartment and
is spending a lot of time here!

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.920
I'll be here for summer vacation.

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:33.770
Nice to meet you.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:38.800
By the way,

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:42.400
are you interested in things like this?

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:44.520
A unicorn horn!

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:47.590
Stop it!

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:54.770
Ochazuke after sake is so great!

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:59.670
Plump eel and crunchy cucumbers,
the perfect combination!

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:05.470
And the kiwi sherbet Hase-kun 
brought me is amazing, too!

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:06.930
Akine-san,

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:09.940
is that the whole pack?

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.760
What's wrong, boy?

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:18.480
You're very good at using chopsticks, huh?

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.880
Am I?

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:25.850
I was born in the east and grew up here.

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:27.040
I doubt it.

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:32.880
It seems you and I are 
drawn together somehow.

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:34.950
Perhaps.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.760
<b>Bad Feeling</b>

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:39.770
That unicorn horn...

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:41.540
I'll take it.

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:42.650
How much?

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:49.210
It's been so long since 
someone's taken me seriously.

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:50.680
How much will you pay?

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:51.800
Thirty thousand yen.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:54.290
That's a good price.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:56.150
This thing's real!

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.310
I'd need 100,000 minimum!

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:01.630
<i>A hundred thousand yen
for a real unicorn horn?</i>

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:02.930
<i>Isn't that cheap?</i>

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:05.210
<i>I don't know.</i>

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:07.370
I don't believe you,

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:09.200
so 32,000 yen.

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:12.840
Believe me.

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:14.020
Eighty thousand yen.

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:16.280
We just met, though.

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:18.130
Thirty-five thousand yen.

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:22.150
I have Yushi-kun to guarantee for me.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:23.660
Seventy-five thousand yen.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.640
He's not up to the job.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:28.580
Thirty-eight thousand yen.

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:29.460
Hey!

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:31.440
Very well.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:33.760
I'll throw in something extra.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:34.730
Seventy thousand yen.

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:36.190
Fifty thousand yen.

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:37.430
Sixty thousand yen.

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:39.160
Very well.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:41.030
<b>Negotiations Successful</b>

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.410
Hooray!

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:45.440
I got the last one!

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:47.450
It's so pretty!

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:51.320
The unicorn horn heals all illnesses,

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:53.220
and reflects curses.

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:55.260
Now you'll be safe.

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:57.670
So what do I get extra?

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:03.450
This feels a little too 
good to be "extra," but...

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:08.960
A unicorn?

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.800
It's rare and uncensored.

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:13.410
Inaba...

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:15.390
If you want this, you can have it.

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:17.300
Nah.

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:19.820
I see.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:22.010
That training sounds hard.

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:23.570
Yeah.

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:25.820
You lost ten kilograms at once?

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:27.970
That has to have hit you hard mentally.

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:29.120
It was hard, huh?

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:30.530
Yeah.

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:33.250
Divine Inspiration, huh?

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:37.000
I'd want to bathe in 
golden rain showers, too.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:41.220
Since you worked so hard, you must've 
seen something amazing, right?

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:43.180
You're amazing.

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:44.250
Yeah.

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:50.780
<i>Having someone who'll look 
at you objectively is great.</i>

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:57.490
<i>Is it true that you know yourself 
better than anyone, anyway?</i>

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:00.730
<i>There're some things only you know,</i>

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:04.470
<i>but there are a lot of things 
that you can't know on your own.</i>

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:09.160
<i>Things you don't want to know...</i>

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.400
<i>Things you don't want to admit.</i>

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:14.240
<i>And so you lock them away in your heart.</i>

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:19.490
<i>But Hase opened that door.</i>

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:21.910
<i>Even if it's something 
I didn't want to hear,</i>

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:23.370
<i>or something that upset me,</i>

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:26.320
<i>he explained it in a way I could understand.</i>

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:30.660
<i>He's always fair and accurate.</i>

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:32.750
<i>That's who Hase is,</i>

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:37.350
<i>and that's why when he says something,
 I can listen to him.</i>

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:41.670
A third eye, huh?

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.200
I should've figured you'd know about it.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:49.020
It's in a lot of manga and fantasy 
novels as a sign of magical power.

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:52.450
But it's funny, isn't it?

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:56.830
Smashing his head into mine
and saying, "Now you've got it!"

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:59.120
A powerful psychic doing that?

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.010
Kinda funny, huh?

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:02.870
Give it to me, too.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.320
Ryu-san's third eye.

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:07.590
Give it to me.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:10.920
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:14.330
Ow!

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.220
Okay!

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:17.980
Now it's mine!

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.130
You little...

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:20.800
blockhead!

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:24.970
Sorry, sorry.

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:26.660
She was really loud, wasn't she?

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:28.470
Mommy was being really loud!

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:29.990
Who are you calling "Mommy"?

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:32.020
Sorry, Kuri.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:45.660
He's way more of a blockhead than he looks.

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:50.010
Landlord?

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:54.600
<b>Book of Blessings</b>

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:54.610
The rent? Of course.

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:56.500
Um, well...

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.690
<i>Oh, crap!</i>

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:59.470
<i>I completely forgot this month's rent!</i>

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:02.730
<b>Book of Blessings</b>

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:02.340
<i>Last month I was late, too, 
so this is really awkward.</i>

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:10.240
Eh?

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:13.980
<i>What was that about?</i>

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:16.630
Inaba, what's wrong?

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:21.100
I just met the landlord, but he ignored me.

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:22.830
Oh, right.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:25.710
<b>Receipt for August</b>

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:25.710
<b>Landlord</b>

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:25.710
I paid this month's rent.

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:28.450
When?!

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:30.130
Be quiet!

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:31.670
Are you okay with that?

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:36.060
Yeah. You're letting me stay at your place.
At least let me do that much.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:39.820
Oh, I paid for my food, too.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:40.400
<b>Receipt for Mizuki Hase, August</b>

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:40.400
<b>Landlord</b>

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:42.510
Which means he paid 50,000 yen?

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:45.440
Now we'll be together all summer!

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.780
<i>Hase...</i>

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.280
<i>You...</i>

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:50.320
<i>Why do you have so much money?</i>

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:53.260
<i>No, you just paid 60,000 before, right?</i>

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:55.460
<i>I have to get up early...</i>

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:59.950
<i>But what I need to say is one thing...</i>

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.180
Please stay forever, Hase-sama!

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:04.720
Sure thing.

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:09.130
Awoo! Awoo!

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:11.180
Chirpity-chirp!

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.790
Did you think we were dogs?

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:14.850
Too bad, we're birds!

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.560
Awoo, chirp!

00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:27.480
Namu kara tannou torayaya
namu oriya boryokichi shifuraya...

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:31.210
Fujisato bouya mokosato bouya...

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:31.210
Okay, that's all.

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:33.020
Yes!

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:35.730
I'm so hungry.

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:39.360
I'm getting used to this
new training, huh, Akine-san?

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:41.660
I want a waterfall.

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:47.590
I was just thinking that a hose 
isn't cutting it anymore.

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:50.000
And so, we need a waterfall.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:51.840
I see...

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:56.550
Yushi-kun leveled up, and I 
want to wear a swimsuit.

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:57.990
A waterfall, huh?

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:01.130
I don't think that's possible.

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:04.310
Let's ask the landlord.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.550
Can he do that?

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:06.980
Yeah.

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.400
Thanks for the food!

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:13.160
I'll go ask Fujiyuki-sensei what 
kind of waterfall is best.

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:17.060
Training under a waterfall now?

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:18.340
Rough!

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:20.050
That's not funny!

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:23.090
It'd be better to dig in 
next to the hot springs.

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:25.860
And you can drink while 
watching the waterfall!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.690
I like that!

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:30.340
The landlord could do that!

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.210
Okay, let's go talk to him!

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:34.400
Landlord!

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:39.590
Why not have him dig a 
randomly generated dungeon?

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:40.660
It'd be good training right?

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:41.340
No, thank you!

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:52.860
This is the Kotobuki-so.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.100
<i>Inaba?</i>

00:16:54.100 --> 00:16:55.130
<i>It's me.</i>

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:56.680
What do you want, Tashiro?

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:57.810
<i>Big news!</i>

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.970
<i>Toshizo-chan is in the hospital!</i>

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.000
<b>Class 2-C Homeroom Teacher:
Toshizo Hayasaka</b>

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:02.000
Hayasaka-sensei is?

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:06.250
So a new teacher's coming!

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:09.160
It's a young man, supposedly.

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:11.710
<i>Where does she get this information?</i>

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:14.070
<i>I wonder what they're like?</i>

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:16.240
<i>I mean, I like Toshizo-chan, but...</i>

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:17.890
Right, right.

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:19.760
We'll talk later about it.

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:20.680
Bye.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.870
<i>A new teacher, huh?</i>

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:31.200
Hey, what's wrong?

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:32.860
Landlord!

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:34.270
He's all white!

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:36.190
Oh, Yushi!

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:37.770
Akira-san!

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:39.100
It's ready.

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:41.580
Go to the baths.

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:52.880
It's a waterfall.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.270
And... the night sky.

00:17:56.270 --> 00:17:58.270
Where's it connected to?

00:17:58.270 --> 00:17:59.400
Wow.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:03.920
The Yokai Apartments are amazing. 
That's all I can say.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:05.870
I like it.

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.340
Classy!

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:08.570
Good work, Landlord.

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:12.660
This is nice.

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:14.250
Have a drink.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:15.350
Thanks so much.

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:17.770
And snacks from Ruriruri!

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:20.240
Fugu ovaries in salt!

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:25.510
This is amazing!

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:27.070
I can't wait for winter.

00:18:27.070 --> 00:18:28.570
And for watching the snow and drinking!

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:32.210
<i>These guys are great at enjoying life.</i>

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:36.390
Hase, Kuri, let's go in, too.

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:37.140
Yeah!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:41.250
You idiot!

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:43.810
You'll spill the sake!

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:47.500
Is it true the waterfall's ready?

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:48.920
I'll join in, too!

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:50.730
It's so pretty!

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:52.620
Mariko-san, hide your front!

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:56.810
Morning!

00:18:57.750 --> 00:19:00.250
We're starting training 
with waterfalls today!

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:03.410
Akine-san, why are you dressed like that?

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.110
I'll join in!

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:05.660
Right...

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:08.620
This is nice.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.080
The ideal amount of water.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.930
Akine-san, the water means 
I can't see the words!

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:18.680
Yushi-kun, you should remember them.

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:20.660
I'll chant them with you.

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:21.670
Ready...

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:30.170
Namu kara tannou torayaya
namu oriya boryokichi shifuraya...

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:34.380
Fujisato bouya mokosato bouya...

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:38.360
Okay, done!

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:50.580
It's been a while since it's been that hard.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.080
You'll get used to it quick.

00:19:52.530 --> 00:19:55.870
But there's a hot spring 
right in front of me!

00:19:58.620 --> 00:20:00.310
This is so nice.

00:20:00.310 --> 00:20:02.390
That felt great, huh?

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:03.730
Let's do it tomorrow!

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:07.140
<i>She's one amazing high school girl.</i>

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:12.640
This is the best way to spend summer.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.640
It's best when it's hot, huh?

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:17.900
<b>Table Salt</b>

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:17.900
Thanks, Ruriko-san.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:31.440
<i>It's going, going... gone!</i>

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:33.000
<i>Goodbye, goodbye!</i>

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.780
<i>Summer vacation was almost over.</i>

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:39.160
Sorry I'm late, Mom, Dad.

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:42.790
I'm so busy with work 
and training every day.

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.800
Especially training!

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:45.750
Waterfalls!

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:47.220
They've got me training with waterfalls!

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:49.460
The world's big, huh?

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:54.140
I don't know how far I can go, but I'll try.

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:57.210
Going forward is so much fun now.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:00.150
I'll keep stumbling here and there,

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:03.820
but I have people to 
train me and support me.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:07.030
I want to do my best for them.

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:10.190
<i>And someday...</i>

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:13.690
<i>The chance that brought 
me to the Yokai Apartments</i>

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:17.690
<i>will seem to me to be inevitable, I hope.</i>

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:20.930
<i>So you don't have to worry.</i>

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:14.550
So what's our new teacher like?

00:23:14.550 --> 00:23:16.950
I'd be so happy if he's cute.

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:19.500
I'd like an old man.

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:22.550
He wouldn't get mad if we ate in class.

00:23:22.550 --> 00:23:25.570
Then a cute old man would be best, right?

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:27.010
Agreed!

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:28.290
Not agreed!

00:23:28.620 --> 00:23:30.800
Next time on <i>Elegant Yokai Apartment Life</i>:

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:33.350
"A New Teacher Arrives."

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:33.350
<b>Fifteenth Haunting
 A New Teacher Arrives</b>

00:23:33.340 --> 00:23:35.330
A new club member, too?
